{"4231240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brawl Party", "steam_appid": 4231240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawl Party is a 2–8 player multiplayer party game built around fast-paced mini-games and strategic Night Game battles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/509ed3db3594ad41c7d3289c76a4a725.avif?t=1782384252\" width=1200 height=417 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will face off in a variety of mini-games where quick reflexes, smart positioning, and well-timed interference decide the winner. Each mini-game will start with random, round-specific power-ups, pushing players to make instant decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between mini-games, the Night Game will bring all players into a shrinking arena. Earned gold can be spent on permanent upgrades, and survival will become more important than ever. Winning mini-games will grant an advantage — but in the end, only one player will reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after being eliminated, players won’t be left out of the action. They will be able to interfere with opponents from afar, disrupt the balance, and change the course of the match. In Brawl Party, no moment will go to waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/c7d09833ccceeab6ab27d0957f69d12b.poster.avif?t=1782384252\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/c7d09833ccceeab6ab27d0957f69d12b.webm?t=1782384252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/c7d09833ccceeab6ab27d0957f69d12b.mp4?t=1782384252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and competitive mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Round-based, mini-game-specific random power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Game battles featuring permanent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminated players can continue to affect the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online &amp; local multiplayer for 2–8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/53d94323b3d612a872453c1066adc294.poster.avif?t=1782384252\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/53d94323b3d612a872453c1066adc294.webm?t=1782384252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/53d94323b3d612a872453c1066adc294.mp4?t=1782384252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINI-GAME HIGHLIGHTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushroom Hunt</strong><br>Players will collect mushrooms to grow bigger, knock mushrooms out of opponents’ hands, or steal them to gain the advantage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platform</strong><br>Players will jump across fragile platforms, avoid the lava, and even after falling, eliminated players will still be able to interfere with opponents from afar.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour</strong><br>Players will race uphill through forest obstacles, stun rivals, and fight to avoid falling back to checkpoints.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/c9f1d8a14d317ff0ec29ec4e07863e3a.poster.avif?t=1782384252\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/c9f1d8a14d317ff0ec29ec4e07863e3a.webm?t=1782384252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/c9f1d8a14d317ff0ec29ec4e07863e3a.mp4?t=1782384252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Brawl Party to your wishlist and get ready to join this chaotic party on launch day.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawl Party is a 2–8 player multiplayer party game built around fast-paced mini-games and strategic Night Game battles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/509ed3db3594ad41c7d3289c76a4a725.avif?t=1782384252\" width=1200 height=417 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will face off in a variety of mini-games where quick reflexes, smart positioning, and well-timed interference decide the winner. Each mini-game will start with random, round-specific power-ups, pushing players to make instant decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between mini-games, the Night Game will bring all players into a shrinking arena. Earned gold can be spent on permanent upgrades, and survival will become more important than ever. Winning mini-games will grant an advantage — but in the end, only one player will reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after being eliminated, players won’t be left out of the action. They will be able to interfere with opponents from afar, disrupt the balance, and change the course of the match. In Brawl Party, no moment will go to waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/c7d09833ccceeab6ab27d0957f69d12b.poster.avif?t=1782384252\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/c7d09833ccceeab6ab27d0957f69d12b.webm?t=1782384252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/c7d09833ccceeab6ab27d0957f69d12b.mp4?t=1782384252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and competitive mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Round-based, mini-game-specific random power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Game battles featuring permanent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminated players can continue to affect the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online &amp; local multiplayer for 2–8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/53d94323b3d612a872453c1066adc294.poster.avif?t=1782384252\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/53d94323b3d612a872453c1066adc294.webm?t=1782384252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/53d94323b3d612a872453c1066adc294.mp4?t=1782384252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINI-GAME HIGHLIGHTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushroom Hunt</strong><br>Players will collect mushrooms to grow bigger, knock mushrooms out of opponents’ hands, or steal them to gain the advantage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platform</strong><br>Players will jump across fragile platforms, avoid the lava, and even after falling, eliminated players will still be able to interfere with opponents from afar.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour</strong><br>Players will race uphill through forest obstacles, stun rivals, and fight to avoid falling back to checkpoints.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/c9f1d8a14d317ff0ec29ec4e07863e3a.poster.avif?t=1782384252\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/c9f1d8a14d317ff0ec29ec4e07863e3a.webm?t=1782384252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231240/extras/c9f1d8a14d317ff0ec29ec4e07863e3a.mp4?t=1782384252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Brawl Party to your wishlist and get ready to join this chaotic party on launch day.</p>", "short_description": "Brawl Party is a 2–8 player multiplayer party game where fast-paced mini-games and competitive Night Game battles turn friends into rivals. Outplay everyone and be the last one standing. Wishlist Brawl Party to follow its development.", "s